<title>DENMARK: Danish Oct wholesale prices up 1.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Danish Oct wholesale prices up 1.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish wholesale prices rose 0.2 percent in October from September but were up 1.4 percent from October 1995, the national statistics office said on Monday.  </p>
<p>					Oct 1996  Sept 1996   Oct 1995</p>
<p>    Change on month (percent)    +0.2     0.0	   -0.2</p>
<p>    Change on year (percent)     +1.4    +1.0	   +2.2</p>
<p>    Index (base year 1990=100)  104.4    104.2	 103.0</p>
<p>NOTE - The statistics office changed the index base year to 1990 from 1980, effective April 1994. An analyst panel polled by Reuters forecast average WPI rises of 1.3 percent on an annual basis and 0.2 percent on a monthly basis for October.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33-969652</p>
